i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3vy5gayGBv8Q7kNvwEDnula&_nc_oc=AdoElwrbFXhQnhlLFyeW-eBmjoSjgM2B8WbaptJGnqL8Y0HqVzTTOT54Xtg8-2VGb8o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQHrg2qmMuzD85nIo3givqvAJ4Cwr6bOFkHW85K001kBQ&oe=6AF1FE63"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8q7pTlCMpToQ7kNvwHIGc0m&_nc_oc=AdqySEeXRoOImmbxAL0lPP9P7l24s3fyenhYaA-A0M4wi8By6MPwZIfxjWkXqV4JY4I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ8Eb6Q_7H0RhvVb3k9fXWV3lrb2tzJraWg30PZjuP6Ew&oe=6AF1EA5D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bpo9hK8Y2z8Q7kNvwGwIB5s&_nc_oc=Adrh-J5zs2fbhtnsiShDpei7K_521-tVatCm6Y0Ox0NIMwSnXdUaR_Dl2YoRdhoF0uc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTdc4esgATbHnM0FMa5QMgoIET6CurhfspG_rTSaGEPBQ&oe=6AF1D8CA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im